From 374896952ab6dd210acd62e60ca78373114f351e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jelle Jassies <jellejassies@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Apr 2026 04:52:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: T1.3-T1.10 + T2.7 DC integration improvements

T1.3: send_sample_rate() uses self_info.sample_rate (was hardcoded 48000)
T1.4: send_encoding() uses self_info.bits_per_sample; BITS_PER_SAMPLE env var
T1.5: firmware_version_bytes derived from Cargo macros, used in send_board_info()
T1.6: Uncomment rate-limit fields in send_board_info() (0xbf=5, 0xc3=3, 0xc7=3)
T1.7: Uncomment product version write at 0x12c in send_product_info()
T1.8: Add tx_latency_ns to DeviceInfo; fix mDNS TX channel/bundle latency_ns records
T1.9: Lower cmcp_vers from 1.2.0 to 1.0.0 (only CMCPv1.0 opcodes implemented)
T1.10: Uncomment real 0x1102 property schema response in arc_server
T2.7: Rate-limit clock-unavailable error logs to once per 30s in flows_tx

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 inferno_aoip/src/device_info.rs               |  1 +
 inferno_aoip/src/device_server/arc_server.rs  |  8 ++--
 inferno_aoip/src/device_server/flows_tx.rs    | 23 ++++++++---
 .../src/device_server/info_mcast_server.rs    | 39 +++++++++++--------
 inferno_aoip/src/device_server/mdns_server.rs |  6 +--
 inferno_aoip/src/device_server/settings.rs    |  9 ++++-
 6 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 30 deletions(-)

diff --git a/inferno_aoip/src/device_info.rs b/inferno_aoip/src/device_info.rs
